<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπᾱΐσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαιθρ-ᾴσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dart beneath,</i> c. acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαιναν φρῖχ᾽ ὑπαΐξει</span>
			(where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ</span>, v. l. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαλύξει</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.126
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dart from under,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμοῦ ὑπαΐξας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.310
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπᾴξας διὰ θυρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					301
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ-</span>
			).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
